Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:45.29,Hook,,0,0,0,,¿QUE SI QUIERO CORRER?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Si quieren entrarle a la\Nacción, tenemos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:03.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}muchas motos para rentar\Npor allá
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.18,0:00:08.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¿En serio me preguntas\Neso, carajo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:11.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Que si quiero? ¿Cómo que\Nsi quiero?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:12.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Quítense del camino,\Nquítense!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:14.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡No puede ser!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:15.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Dios mío!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:19.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Dios mío! ¿Qué está\Npasando?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.14,0:00:21.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Dios mío! ¿Qué está\Npasando?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:25.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Mierda, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:26.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué se me atravesó?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:28.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Dónde está mi Jason?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:29.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Dónde está Jason?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:30.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Va adelante?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.33,0:00:33.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Hay alguien adelante\Nahorita, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:34.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Voy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:36.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}en cuarto lugar, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:37.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Soy una basura.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:39.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Voy por el primer lugar!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.15,0:00:43.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Oye, esto me encanta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.23,0:00:45.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Está divertido.
